      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.05.060 block 34",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 34,
          "component_id": "ba276167-e907-530e-b9e7-209a6ed3fef7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1233,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.05.060:block:34",
          "start": 1012
        },
        "quote": "(c) The following enumerated factors and review process are hereby adopted by the City to evaluate any reductions of stormwater utility fees charged to properties which are located within a duly created drainage district:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.05.060:block:34#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.05.060 block 35",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 35,
          "component_id": "908fb556-d161-5730-b894-36530141e4c3",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1412,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.05.060:block:35",
          "start": 1234
        },
        "quote": "(1) Quantify the functional activities and frequency for the activities that are being performed within a drainage district’s boundary within the City’s service area by the City.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.05.060:block:35#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.05.060 block 36",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 36,
          "component_id": "a0fbddc4-4d62-561d-b6e0-c8f6dc901796",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1604,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.05.060:block:36",
          "start": 1413
        },
        "quote": "(2) Quantify the functional activities and frequency for the activities that are being performed within a drainage district’s boundary within the City’s service area by the drainage district.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.05.060:block:36#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.05.060 block 37",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 37,
          "component_id": "ea266437-24df-5f94-9553-a27070f3f6a7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1954,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.05.060:block:37",
          "start": 1605
        },
        "quote": "(3) If an identical function is being performed by the drainage district and is not replicated by the City within the drainage district’s service area, quantify the specific unit of service, including but not limited to length, cross-section area, surface area, number of structures, rehabilitation activities and the frequency for this performance.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.05.060:block:37#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.05.060 block 38",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 38,
          "component_id": "ef709cdf-6d2e-522a-adf7-30a22afe66c4",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2133,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.05.060:block:38",
          "start": 1955
        },
        "quote": "(4) Compare the same function and frequency with the costs appropriate for the City staff to perform an identical activity utilizing the City’s budget for that specific function.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.05.060:block:38#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.05.060 block 39",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 39,
          "component_id": "f2a1b840-e346-518d-95b4-c9d6e89c7a69",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2362,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.05.060:block:39",
          "start": 2134
        },
        "quote": "(5) Utilizing the City’s cost for a function and the specific units accomplished in the drainage district’s boundary, extend the unit cost times the units accomplished to obtain the total annual cost for all identical functions.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.05.060:block:39#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.05.060 block 40",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 40,
          "component_id": "d623431e-f76c-5d97-a51f-70738a5ab8ee",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2624,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.05.060:block:40",
          "start": 2363
        },
        "quote": "(6) Utilizing the total costs for all functions provided by the drainage district based upon City unit costs, divide this total cost by the ERUs within the drainage district (divided by 12 to obtain monthly) and obtain a “drainage district ERU equivalent cost.”",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.05.060:block:40#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.05.060 block 41",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 41,
          "component_id": "9b42afa0-66d7-5ef6-9af2-3a474db3eafe",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2819,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.05.060:block:41",
          "start": 2625
        },
        "quote": "(7) For all parcels within the specific drainage district boundary and within the City limits, subtract the “drainage district ERU equivalent cost” from the City’s stormwater ERU rate (monthly).",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.05.060:block:41#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.05.060 block 42",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 42,
          "component_id": "e5026a05-ef2b-5b45-8b45-ede206389620",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3367,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.05.060:block:42",
          "start": 2820
        },
        "quote": "(d) The Utilities Department is directed to annually review, utilizing the factors and process referenced herein, and determine monetary savings, if any, to the City for stormwater services provided by duly created drainage districts. The Utilities Department shall report its determination of savings to the stormwater utility, if any, to the Governing Body by June 15th of each year. Rate reductions for properties within duly created drainage districts shall be adopted by separate ordinance and be based upon savings to the stormwater utility.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.05.060:block:42#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.05.060 block 43",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 43,
          "component_id": "5ff914c0-1854-5f50-aaa4-52f84f024685",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3534,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.05.060:block:43",
          "start": 3368
        },
        "quote": "(e) Utilizing the enumerated factors and review process adopted herein, the stormwater rate reduction for the following duly created drainage districts is as follows:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.05.060:block:43#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.05.060 block 44",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 44,
          "component_id": "36ecfa0d-5737-59dd-8b0a-6e3a7a5d33ec",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3660,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.05.060:block:44",
          "start": 3535
        },
        "quote": "Shunganunga Drainage District | 0\nKaw River Drainage District | 0\nNorth Topeka Drainage District (per ERU, per month) | $0.83",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.05.060:block:44#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
